
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>BORUN AI</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#10131b;color:white;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
header{padding:20px;background:#191f2c;font-size:23px;font-weight:bold}
header span{color:#8290ff}
main{max-width:800px;margin:auto;padding:25px 15px 130px}
.welcome{text-align:center;margin-top:17vh}
.logo{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8290ff,#a879ed);width:65px;height:65px;border-radius:20px;margin:auto;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold}
h1{font-size:30px}
#messages{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:15px}
.message{padding:15px;border-radius:15px;line-height:1.5;max-width:90%;white-space:pre-wrap}
.user{background:#293650;align-self:flex-end}
.bot{background:#202838;align-self:flex-start}
form{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;background:#10131b;padding:15px;display:flex;gap:10px}
input{flex:1;min-width:0;padding:15px;border-radius:13px;border:1px solid #39445a;background:#202838;color:white;font-size:16px}
button{border:0;border-radius:13px;background:#8290ff;color:white;padding:0 20px;font-size:20px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header> BORUN <span>AI</span></header>
<main>
<div class="welcome" id="welcome">
<div class="logo">B</div>
<h1>Чем могу помочь?</h1>
<p>Добро пожаловать в BORUN AI</p>
</div>
<div id="messages"></div>
</main>
<form id="form">
<input id="input" placeholder="Напиши сообщение..." autocomplete="off">
<button type="submit">➤</button>
</form>
<script>
const form=document.getElementById("form");
const input=document.getElementById("input");
const messages=document.getElementById("messages");
const welcome=document.getElementById("welcome");

form.addEventListener("submit",function(e){
e.preventDefault();
const text=input.value.trim();
if(!text)return;
welcome.style.display="none";

const user=document.createElement("div");
user.className="message user";
user.textContent=text;
messages.appendChild(user);

const answer=document.createElement("div");
answer.className="message bot";
answer.textContent="Привет! Я BORUN AI. Твоё сообщение получено. Скоро я научусь отвечать на вопросы с помощью настоящего ИИ.";
messages.appendChild(answer);

input.value="";
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
